. Other Retention`},{id:`section-12`,title:`12. Account Deletion and Anonymisation`},{id:`section-13`,title:`13. Your Rights and Choices`},{id:`section-14`,title:`14. Children's Privacy`},{id:`section-15`,title:`15. International Data Transfers`},{id:`section-16`,title:`16. Data Breach and Security Incidents`},{id:`section-17`,title:`17. Changes to This Privacy Policy`},{id:`section-18`,title:`18. Contact and Complaints`}];function Gl({onNavigate:e}){return(0,$.jsxs)(Ul,{title:`Privacy Policy`,subtitle:`How SkillSwap processes, protects, and manages user data across peer exchanges.`,lastUpdated:`October 2026`,tocItems:Wl,activeDoc:`privacy-policy`,onNavigate:e,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`div`,{className:`legal-intro-box`,children:(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{className:`legal-intro-text`,children:`SkillSwap is a platform for peer-to-peer skill exchange. This Privacy Policy explains what information we handle, why we need it, when it may be shared, how we protect it, and how long different types of information are retained.`})}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-1`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`1. Introduction and Scope`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`This Privacy Policy applies to all services, features, web applications, and interactive tools provided by SkillSwap (collectively, the "Platform"). It describes how we collect, store, access, process, transfer, and delete personal data when you create an account, browse listings, exchange skills, upload files, participate in workspace chats, or otherwise interact with the Platform.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`By accessing or using SkillSwap, you acknowledge the data handling practices described in this policy. If you do not agree with these practices, you should discontinue use of the Platform.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-2`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`2. Who We Are`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`SkillSwap operates as a peer-to-peer skill exchange ecosystem.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-3`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`3. Information We Collect`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`We collect information directly from you when you provide it to us, automatically as you navigate through the Platform, and through interaction with other participants during skill exchanges:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Account & Authentication Information:`}),` Email address, hashed password credentials, single sign-on (OAuth) tokens provided by third-party identity providers (such as Google or GitHub), email verification status, and session authentication state.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Public Profile Information:`}),` Display name / full name, unique username identifier, avatar image URL, biography, geographic location, member registration date, listed offer skills, listed request skills, and completed exchange statistics.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Private Contact Information:`}),` Private contact details (such as phone number, preferred email, or WhatsApp contact) provided separately during onboarding or profile management, stored in restricted access tables.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Skill Exchange & Transaction Information:`}),` Swap proposal details, swap descriptions, requested/offered skill credits, exchange requirements, swap status transitions (e.g., proposed, accepted, submitted, completed, cancelled), and non-monetary SkillCredits ledger accounting records.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Reviews and Ratings:`}),` Star ratings, written review notes, feedback, and timestamp metadata submitted by exchange partners upon completion of a swap.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Communication & Chat Content:`}),` Direct messaging text, transaction status updates, and workspace chat interactions exchanged between matched swap participants.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`File Attachments & Metadata:`}),` Creator swap attachments, workspace chat attachments, work submission files, stored object file paths, original filenames, MIME types, and file size metadata.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Technical & Session Information:`}),` Browser local storage keys (such as active authentication session tokens), system log correlation IDs (e.g., request correlation identifiers), and basic request headers necessary for security enforcement.`]})]})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-4`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`4. Information You Make Public`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`SkillSwap is a public peer-to-peer marketplace. Because the platform connects users seeking to trade expertise, certain profile and activity information is intentionally visible to other users and platform visitors:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`li`,{children:`Your public profile (display name, username, avatar image, biography, location, offered skills, and requested skills) is publicly accessible across the marketplace.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`li`,{children:`Published swap listings (titles, category, credit value, requirements, and creator identity) are displayed on public discovery pages.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`li`,{children:`Star ratings, public review comments, and completed swap count statistics are attached to your public profile to build trust within the community.`})]}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`Conversely, your private contact details are subject to access controls and are not displayed on your public profile card.`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`p`,{className:`legal-warning-text`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Important Note:`}),` Never include sensitive personal details (such as financial account numbers, government identifiers, or home addresses) in your public biography, public swap descriptions, or public reviews.`]})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-5`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`5. How We Use Information`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`We use the information we process for the following operational purposes:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Platform Service Provision:`}),` Creating and managing your user account, matching skill exchange listings, processing SkillCredits double-entry ledger transfers, and enabling workspace communication.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Identity Verification & Access Control:`}),` Authenticating user logins, verifying email addresses, enforcing Row Level Security (RLS) policies, and maintaining session security.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Workspace Collaboration:`}),` Facilitating direct participant messaging, file attachment uploads, and work submission delivery between matched swap partners.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Security & Integrity:`}),` Monitoring for rate limit violations, detecting unauthorized access attempts, enforcing file upload safety constraints, and redacting sensitive system log parameters.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Support & Communication:`}),` Responding to user support inquiries, technical assistance requests, and platform notifications.`]})]})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-6`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`6. Lawful Processing`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`We process personal information under the following legal bases:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Contractual Necessity:`}),` Processing required to provide SkillSwap services, execute swap transactions, manage SkillCredits balances, and fulfill our agreement with you under the Terms of Service.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Legitimate Interests:`}),` Processing necessary to maintain platform security, prevent fraud, protect system integrity, and facilitate user communication.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Legal Obligation:`}),` Processing necessary to comply with applicable laws, legal process, court orders, or lawful requests from regulatory authorities.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Consent:`}),` Where you have provided explicit consent for specific optional data processing (such as sharing optional contact channels).`]})]})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-7`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`7. How We Share Information`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. Information is shared strictly under the following circumstances:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`With Swap Counterparties:`}),` When you enter into a skill swap, your exchange partner can see your public identity, workspace chat messages, and shared attachment files required to fulfill the exchange.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`With Infrastructure Providers:`}),` We rely on specialized cloud infrastructure providers to host and secure the Platform:`,(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Supabase:`}),` Cloud database, authentication gateway, Row Level Security engine, and file storage bucket host.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Cloudflare:`}),` Content delivery network (CDN), Edge Workers, security header enforcement, and reverse proxy routing.`]})]})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Legal and Regulatory Compliance:`}),` Disclosures permitted or required under Section 8 of this policy.`]})]})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-8`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`8. Legal, Government, and Law-Enforcement Requests`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`SkillSwap may preserve, access, restrict, or disclose personal information, account information, communications, files, or other records when reasonably required or permitted by applicable law, valid legal process, court or regulatory order, or lawful government or law-enforcement request.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`Where legally permitted and reasonably practicable, SkillSwap may review or challenge requests that are invalid or excessively broad and may provide notice before disclosure.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`SkillSwap may be unable to provide notice where prohibited by law, court order, or where doing so could interfere with an investigation or create another legally recognized restriction.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-9`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`9. Security`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`We implement technical, structural, and administrative safeguards to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Supabase Authentication:`}),` Secure password hashing and token-based session verification.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Database Row Level Security (RLS):`}),` Server-enforced policies restricting record queries and mutations strictly to authorized row owners and swap participants.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Private Storage Buckets:`}),` Storage buckets requiring authenticated signed URLs with short-term expiry for accessing attachment files.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Restricted Private Contacts:`}),` Contact information is stored in restricted database tables isolated from public profile queries.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Scoped Workspace Messaging:`}),` Chat messages and chat attachments are accessible exclusively to verified swap participants.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`File Validation Controls:`}),` Client-side and server-side file size restrictions (25 MB max), filename sanitization, and path traversal defenses.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Sanitized Logging & Correlation IDs:`}),` Centralized loggers redacting authorization tokens, passwords, and PII while tracking request correlation IDs (`,(0,$.jsx)(`code`,{children:`X-Request-Id`}),`).`]})]}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{className:`legal-note-text`,children:`Please note that no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is completely infallible. While we maintain technical controls to safeguard your data, we cannot guarantee absolute security.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-10`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`10. File Retention`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`SkillSwap enforces an automated storage lifecycle for uploaded files to minimize data retention and conserve storage resources:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Creator Swap Attachments:`}),` Attachments associated with swap proposals are scheduled for automated cleanup approximately `,(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`48 hours`}),` after swap acceptance.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Work Submission Files:`}),` Deliverable files uploaded during work submission are scheduled for automated cleanup approximately `,(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`24 hours`}),` after the relevant submission.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Workspace Chat Attachments:`}),` Media and document files attached inside chat conversations are scheduled for automated cleanup approximately `,(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`6 hours`}),` after creation.`]})]}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`File cleanup processes run asynchronously and background execution timing may vary slightly. Technical logs, security backups, dispute records, or records required for fraud prevention may remain for longer periods where permitted or required by law.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-11`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`11. Other Retention`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`Unaccepted open swaps are automatically expired after 3 days without acceptance. Reserved SkillCredits are released back to the requester, and the credit release is recorded in the SkillCredits transaction ledger. Expired unaccepted swap records are eligible for automated permanent cleanup after 21 days, subject to the platform's attachment/message cleanup and ledger-integrity checks. The platform does not show a user-facing countdown timer for this lifecycle. Credit ledger records may be retained independently where needed for accounting, auditability, security, legal, or account-history purposes.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`Account profile records, public reviews, SkillCredits transaction ledger histories, and core swap metadata are retained for as long as your account remains active or as needed to maintain double-entry audit balance consistency across the Platform.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`Technical correlation logs and system access metadata are periodically rotated or purged according to routine maintenance schedules.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-12`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`12. Account Deletion and Anonymisation`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`You may initiate account deletion at any time through your Profile settings.`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`p`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Current Technical Implementation:`}),` Initiating account deletion executes a profile anonymisation procedure that:`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[`Deletes your private contact details from `,(0,$.jsx)(`code`,{children:`user_private_contacts`}),`.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[`Deletes your associated user skill entries from `,(0,$.jsx)(`code`,{children:`user_skills`}),` and `,(0,$.jsx)(`code`,{children:`user_custom_skills`}),`.`]}),(0,$.jsx)(`li`,{children:`Anonymises your public profile record by setting full name to "Deleted User", clearing biography text, clearing avatar image URL, and clearing username.`}),(0,$.jsx)(`li`,{children:`Terminates your active session and signs you out of the Platform.`})]}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`Please note that under the current technical implementation, the underlying Supabase Auth identity record and past SkillCredits transaction records remain in database archives for security, legal compliance, and double-entry accounting integrity.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-13`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`13. Your Rights and Choices`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Access & Rectification:`}),` You can view and update your public profile, offered skills, and private contact details directly within your account settings.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Account Anonymisation & Deletion:`}),` You can request profile anonymisation and data removal as described in Section 12.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Objection & Restriction:`}),` You may object to or request restrictions on certain processing activities by contacting support.`]})]})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-14`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`14. Children's Privacy`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`SkillSwap is strictly intended for individuals who are at least 18 years old (or the legal age of majority in their jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children under 18. If we learn that we have inadvertently collected personal data from a minor, we will take immediate steps to remove such information and terminate the account.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-15`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`15. International Data Transfers`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`SkillSwap operates globally. Your information may be processed and stored on servers located outside of your state, province, or country, where data protection laws may differ from those in your local jurisdiction. By using the Platform, you consent to the transfer and processing of your information in these global data facilities.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-16`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`16. Data Breach and Security Incidents`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`In the event of a confirmed security incident or unauthorized access compromising personal data, SkillSwap will investigate the incident, take corrective mitigation steps, and notify affected users and supervisory regulatory bodies where required by applicable law and contractual obligations.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-17`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`17. Changes to This Privacy Policy`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in platform features, technical operations, or legal requirements. When updates are published, we will revise the