sions, intellectual property rights, and copyright authorizations prior to uploading or sharing any file on the Platform.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`p`,{className:`legal-warning-text`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`File-Sharing Safety Warning:`}),` SkillSwap does not guarantee that files, messages, documents, or other content provided by another user are accurate, safe, lawful, reliable, free of malicious code, or suitable for the recipient's intended use. Users are responsible for exercising reasonable caution before opening, downloading, executing, or otherwise using files received from another user.`]}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, SkillSwap is not responsible for harm, loss, damage, malware, fraud, infringement, privacy violations, or other consequences arising from files, messages, materials, or other content supplied by another user.`})]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`section`,{id:`section-6`,className:`legal-section`,children:[(0,$.jsx)(`h2`,{className:`legal-section-heading`,children:`6. Prohibited Activities`}),(0,$.jsx)(`p`,{children:`You agree not to engage in any of the following prohibited activities on SkillSwap:`}),(0,$.jsxs)(`ul`,{children:[(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Unlawful & Fraudulent Activity:`}),` Violating any local, state, national, or international law, or conducting fraudulent skill swaps.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Malicious Code & Security Tampering:`}),` Uploading malware, viruses, trojans, keyloggers, or intentionally harmful code, or attempting to bypass rate limits, RLS policies, or authentication controls.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Impersonation & Misrepresentation:`}),` Falsely claiming identity, qualifications, certifications, or affiliation with any person or organization.`]}),(0,$.jsxs)(`li`,{children:[(0,$.jsx)(`strong`,{children:`Harassment & Abuse:`}),` Threatening, harassing, intimidating, defaming, o